<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 4.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   92/94     97/99     UNQ    160/162</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98     99/103  170/173  180/182</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices were steady, following cargo quotes, traders said on Friday. While some shipowners emerged to cover their requirements, others held back, saying current prices were too high and would rather wait. A parcel of 180-cst parcel was traded at $100 per tonne.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
